<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lyme_disease" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lyme_disease</a><br>
<a href="http://lymestats.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">http://lymestats.org/</a></p>
<p>Lyme disease is caused by a spiral shaped bacteria (spirochete) called Borrelia. There are 100 different strains of Borrelia in the USA and 300 worldwide. In the USA, Lyme disease is twice as common as Breast Cancer and six times as common as AIDS.<br>
Source: ILADS</p>
